    "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/guide.html?repo=y1-community%2Fq5-stock-rom&amp;tag=MX2-ES_Q5-WV5.02-20250619#download-updater\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/q5-stock-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-updater.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Get it on Updater CE - with guided install\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### Downloads\n\n**Q5 \u00b7 Stock**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/q5-stock-rom-mirror/releases/download/MX2-ES_Q5-WV5.02-20250619/rom_q5-windows.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/q5-stock-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows for Q5 \u00b7 Stock - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/q5-stock-rom-mirror/releases/download/MX2-ES_Q5-WV5.02-20250619/rom_q5-linux.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/q5-stock-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux for Q5 \u00b7 Stock - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/q5-stock-rom-mirror/releases/download/MX2-ES_Q5-WV5.02-20250619/rom_q5-linux-arm64.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/q5-stock-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux-arm64.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux arm64 for Q5 \u00b7 Stock - portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/y1-community/q5-stock-rom-mirror/releases/download/MX2-ES_Q5-WV5.02-20250619/rom_q5-macos.zip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/q5-stock-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-macos.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for macOS 12+ for Q5 \u00b7 Stock - Intel + Apple silicon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\nOriginal Timmkoo Q5 software **MX2-ES_Q5-WV5.02-20250619**.\n\n- Model: **Q5** (Timmkoo)\n- Package: `rom_q5.zip`\n- Build tag: `MX2-ES_Q5-WV5.02-20250619`\n- Build date: 2025-06-19\n\n## Install\n\n1. Download `rom_q5.zip` (every numbered volume if the release has more than one, then `cat rom_q5.zip.* > rom_q5.zip`).\n2. Unzip it. Keep the scatter file next to the images.\n3. Open SP Flash Tool, choose **Download Only**, load the scatter file from the archive and flash.\n4. Or use Innioasis Updater CE: <https://innioasis.app/guide.html>\n\nThis wipes the player. Back up music and recordings first.\n\n## Files\n\n| File | Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| `rom_q5.zip` | 328.1 MB |\n| `SHA256SUMS` | 0.0 MB |\n\nFull archive: <https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?model=Q5>\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Q5\",\"name\":\"rom_q5-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"989379a8c51ef9d2e63d31a6dd253ccaff64d071d4c01120026f4213fd358cde\",\"size\":553499590,\"source_asset\":\"rom_q5.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Q5\",\"name\":\"rom_q5-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"59a4c97a8c0297e4473871afcaafc00e978fc6f82180c4e5b77944cba368cf64\",\"size\":707619944,\"source_asset\":\"rom_q5.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Q5\",\"name\":\"rom_q5-linux-arm64.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux-arm64\",\"sha256\":\"1f9cd8079170b74e15442b285d1d192df33ffb8cfcf4849e989d60b24d8a50b4\",\"size\":532524886,\"source_asset\":\"rom_q5.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"Q5\",\"name\":\"rom_q5-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"4fd48f8700a64b7c05fbbc43a028f24c4a0dbe7f80ade68c074edf689410ea99\",\"size\":467470746,\"source_asset\":\"rom_q5.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"}],\"built_at\":\"2026-11-11T00:34:15Z\",\"button_assets\":[{\"name\":\"release-button-updater.svg\",\"size\":1540},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows.svg\",\"size\":1522},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux.svg\",\"size\":1518},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux-arm64.svg\",\"size\":1510},{\"name\":\"release-button-macos.svg\",\"size\":1516}],\"failures\":[],\"fingerprint\":\"0e